# Description
A login manager daemon

# Overview
* config file
    * /etc/greetd/config.toml

* config auto login
    * https://man.sr.ht/~kennylevinsen/greetd/#setting-up-auto-login
    ```
    [initial_session]
    command = "weston"
    user = "alan"
    ```
    $ systemctl restart greetd.service

